  "title": "Make crc32 use zlib function when available",
  "description": "In my benchmark, the zlib CRC32 implementation is faster than the wireshark implementation by a factor of roughly 1.5. If the user uses the Chromium fork of zlib, it will be even faster.\n\nSide note: there's no particular reason to define `ZLIB_CONST` in this case, but the existing code do that so I follow.",
